Now,

If all letters are dropped, we keep only symbols.

Original series: L U £ P $ D A Ω F % * N Q &amp; R # Y @ C K * &amp; M

Removing letters: L, U, P, D, A, F, N, Q, R, Y, C, K, M are removed

Remaining symbols: £ $ Ω % * &amp; # @ * &amp;

Now, writing reduced series: £ $ Ω % * &amp; # @ * &amp;

Now, counting from right side: £ $ Ω **% *** &amp; # @ * &amp;

So, seventh from the right = %

Hence, the correct answer is** Option 2.**

